# WARP-1964 — default host directory for the ERP export-drop track.
#
# docker/docker-compose.yml bind-mounts this read-only into the orchestrator at
# /data/erp-exports when ERP_EXPORT_DROP_HOST_PATH is not overridden. Kept in
# the repo so a fresh checkout composes without Docker having to invent the
# directory as root.
#
# On an appliance this is usually NOT where the files live: point
# ERP_EXPORT_DROP_HOST_PATH at the CIFS mount of the practice's export share
# instead. Nothing is read from anywhere until ERP_EXPORT_DROP_ROOT is set.
#
# Never commit an exported report here — those files are PHI.
